 Coco and Chanel have seen significant growth in popularity for small and toy breeds in recent years.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Can I name my small dog after a large animal?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Absolutely. Names like Bear, Moose, Wolf, Tiger, and Lion for tiny dogs create wonderful affectionate irony that never fails to charm. This naming tradition celebrates the fact that small dogs genuinely believe they are enormous, and honoring that self-perception with an oversized animal name shows you understand your tiny companion deeply.\\\"}]]}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"37:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-12\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"chihuahua\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/chihuahua/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl mb-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"🐕\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Chihuahua\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"pomeranian\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/pomeranian/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 t